    "lines": [
      {
        "scene": "hook",
        "text": "Juicero sold a $699 juicer that only pressed its own packs.",
        "start": 0.3,
        "seconds": 3.55,
        "window": 4.23,
        "fill": 0.839
      },
      {
        "scene": "packs",
        "text": "Each pack held chopped fruit and vegetables, sold for $5 to $7, one glass at a time. So why buy the machine?",
        "start": 4.53,
        "seconds": 5.66,
        "window": 6.17,
        "fill": 0.917
      },
      {
        "scene": "launch",
        "text": "It launched in San Francisco, backed by Google's venture arm and Kleiner Perkins.",
        "start": 10.7,
        "seconds": 3.2,
        "window": 3.87,
        "fill": 0.827
      },
      {
        "scene": "cut",
        "text": "In January, Juicero cut the press from $699 to $399.",
        "start": 14.57,
        "seconds": 4.16,
        "window": 4.83,
        "fill": 0.861
      },
      {
        "scene": "test",
        "text": "Then in April, Bloomberg reporters skipped the press and squeezed the packs with their bare hands.",
        "start": 19.4,
        "seconds": 3.49,
        "window": 4.17,
        "fill": 0.837
      },
      {
        "scene": "result",
        "text": "Their hands got nearly as much juice out, and faster. So who still needed the machine?",
        "start": 23.57,
        "seconds": 3.55,
        "window": 4.2,
        "fill": 0.845
      },
      {
        "scene": "shut",
        "text": "That September, Juicero shut down for good.",
        "start": 27.77,
        "seconds": 1.57,
        "window": 2.23,
        "fill": 0.704
      },
      {
        "scene": "payoff",
        "text": "By then, investors had put about $120M into a juicer that two bare hands could match.",
        "start": 30.0,
        "seconds": 4.61,
        "window": 5.3,
        "fill": 0.87
      },
      {
        "scene": "ending",
        "text": "The machine or the packs: which one sank Juicero? Next time you squeeze a lemon, remember,",
        "start": 35.3,
        "seconds": 3.7,
        "window": 4.37,
        "fill": 0.847
      }
    ]
  },
